{"v":4,"catch":"“Cyber Engine”是一款增量遊戲，您需要在其中構建具有未來主義風格的超級計算機。","desc":"- 按“Y”按鈕賺取您的第一筆錢。\n- 通過購買網絡引擎的新元素（如冷卻器、CPU、晶體管）來增加您的收入。\n- 使用導熱膏升級所有發動機部件。\n- 超頻會減少您的引擎相位，您的超級計算機每秒會賺更多的錢。\n- 學習新技術來打開數據庫、電腦遊戲和互聯網。\n- 當心故障！ 故障每秒鐘都會減少您的收入。\n構建完整的網絡引擎並賺取 10 億美元！","publisher":"RandomSpin Games","release":"2022-06-23","genres":["益智","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f68e61ec5b196ce9324e06a329579655d9bd59318f3ec61f8175051c3eb803b4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d967c421b7dce35f615900fc69d90956726c013427a5d19bedc823ca5f6d23f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f5aeaff0d7116294e194ffe6dbd4d1a6604fd4b9d84078ba97296613923f5cfc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5da74a19fbc4e532c160b2f4075fa9fd35ffc51b99f58d19ff930cda397e18b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3fcc67160de1666f2fed8325be16822f2b5f3dfc02dddb1052513f9ae320b2fe.jpg"],"titleId":"01009b9018b08000","dlc":[]}